<title>LITHUANIA: VILNIAUS BANK INCOME STATEMENT FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>VILNIAUS BANK INCOME STATEMENT FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is the statement of income for the year ended December 31 1996 released on Monday by Lithuania's leading bank Vilniaus Bank. All figures are in thousands of litas.</p>
<p>    Interest income				 67.499</p>
<p>    Interest expenses			     17.374</p>
<p>    Net interest income			   50.125</p>
<p>    Provisions for loan losses		  14.302</p>
<p>    Other provisions				2.263</p>
<p>    Net interest income after provisions    33.560</p>
<p>    Net service charges and other income    32.523</p>
<p>    Foreign exchange gain			 14.156</p>
<p>							  46.679</p>
<p>    Staff costs				     34.549</p>
<p>    Other administrative expenses	     16.968</p>
<p>    All taxes except profit tax		 4.320</p>
<p>							  55.837</p>
<p>    Result from subsidiaries		    38</p>
<p>    Result before tax			     24.440</p>
<p>    Profit tax					-</p>
<p>    Net income					24.440</p>
<p>Operating income per 1 LTL of share capital  1,13</p>
<p>    Net income per 1 LTL of share capital   0,24</p>
<p>--Ed Stoddard, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
